        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.74,
          "end": 43.34,
          "en": "And you should then see this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.34,
          "end": 46.41,
          "en": "Now here, I got a very basic dummy application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.41,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "We can select a topic if you wanna learn more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 50.43,
          "en": "about the basics or components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.43,
          "end": 52.7,
          "en": "And we can switch between those topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.7,
          "end": 54.74,
          "en": "And depending on what we choose,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.74,
          "end": 57.62,
          "en": "the content up there updates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.62,
          "end": 60.09,
          "en": "Now that's definitely not too fancy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.09,
          "end": 61.59,
          "en": "but it is about the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.59,
          "end": 63.95,
          "en": "not about what we see on the screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.95,
          "end": 66.11,
          "en": "And the code is quite interesting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.11,
          "end": 69.83,
          "en": "Here in App.vue, in my main app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.83,
          "end": 73.55,
          "en": "I'm rendering the active element component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.55,
          "end": 76.81,
          "en": "and I'm rendering the knowledge base component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.81,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "So this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "These two components here are getting used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 83.66,
          "en": "in the App.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.66,
          "end": 88.12,
          "en": "Of course, all components are registered in main JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.12,
          "end": 91.173,
          "en": "So they are available to this entire Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 94.77000000000001,
          "en": "Now here's how this app works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 97.46000000000001,
          "en": "Active element is quite straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.46000000000001,
          "end": 99.703,
          "en": "I get a topic title and a text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 104.05,
          "en": "That data is then received as props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.05,
          "end": 107.67,
          "en": "And in App.vue, I'm providing these two props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.67,
          "end": 111.10300000000001,
          "en": "to active element based on the activeTopic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.65,
          "end": 114.47999999999999,
          "en": "Now, what is activeTopic?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 117.4,
          "en": "That is some component internal data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.4,
          "end": 120.8,
          "en": "So that's some data I'm managing in this app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.8,
          "end": 125.67,
          "en": "in this App.vue file, here in my data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 128.03,
          "en": "There, I got an entire array of topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.03,
          "end": 130.77,
          "en": "But below that, I got the activeTopic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "Initially, that's null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "But when this method is triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 138.21,
          "en": "and we'll see when this method is triggered in a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.21,
          "end": 142.59,
          "en": "then I set the activeTopic to one of these two topics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.59,
          "end": 143.863,
          "en": "I got in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.21,
          "end": 147.16,
          "en": "Now, if activeTopic is null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.16,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "thanks to this check I have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 153.43,
          "en": "we'll basically not pass anything relevant to topic title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.43,
          "end": 156.46,
          "en": "But if it's not null, if we do have an active topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.46,
          "end": 160.27,
          "en": "then I provide the title and full text values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.27,
          "end": 161.453,
          "en": "to active element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.3,
          "end": 167.38,
          "en": "Now, how is a topic set as an activeTopic?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.38,
          "end": 171.46,
          "en": "As I said, that happens with the activate topic method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.46,
          "end": 174.2,
          "en": "And in there, we receive a topicID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.2,
          "end": 178.68,
          "en": "and use that ID to identify one of these two topics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.68,
          "end": 180.31,
          "en": "in this topics array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.31,
          "end": 182.26,
          "en": "So when is the method getting triggered?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.26,
          "end": 185.94,
          "en": "Well, that happens on the knowledge base component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.94,
          "end": 189.01,
          "en": "There, I have to select topic custom event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.01,
          "end": 190.23,
          "en": "to which I'm listening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.23,
          "end": 195.15,
          "en": "And when that event fires, activateTopic is triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.15,
          "end": 199.07,
          "en": "Please also note that I'm feeding the entire topics array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.07,
          "end": 201.84,
          "en": "as a value to the topics prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 204.263,
          "en": "on the knowledge base component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 209.09,
          "en": "So let's have a look at the knowledge base component then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.09,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "In there, I'm getting this one topics prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 215.39,
          "en": "and I'm declaring that I'm eventually going to emit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.39,
          "end": 216.683,
          "en": "select-topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.4,
          "end": 221.23,
          "en": "And here is where things get interesting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.23,
          "end": 224.51,
          "en": "and where we can see a little problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.51,
          "end": 227.71,
          "en": "I'm forwarding the topics to the knowledge grid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.71,
          "end": 229.29,
          "en": "which I'm using here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.29,
          "end": 233.38,
          "en": "And I'm basically also just forwarding select-topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.38,
          "end": 236.76,
          "en": "I'm emitting it here in knowledge base, yes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.76,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "But when do I emit it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 243.71,
          "en": "Well, I emit it when knowledge-grid emits select-topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.22,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "So basically knowledge base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 251.58,
          "en": "just acts as a pass through component, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 251.58,
          "end": 254.68,
          "en": "I pass my topics through to knowledge-grid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.68,
          "end": 257.72,
          "en": "and I pass select-topic, this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.72,
          "end": 261.743,
          "en": "through to App.vue when it is emitted by knowledge grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.72,
          "end": 267.5,
          "en": "So knowledge base doesn't really have its own logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.5,
          "end": 269.56,
          "en": "Now still, it's not unrealistic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.56,
          "end": 271.3,
          "en": "to have components like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.3,
          "end": 274.18,
          "en": "maybe because we have certain markup in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.18,
          "end": 276.25,
          "en": "which you wanna contain in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.25,
          "end": 278.72,
          "en": "maybe because you have certain styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.72,
          "end": 281.75,
          "en": "So having such pass through components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.75,
          "end": 284.46,
          "en": "is absolutely not unrealistic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.46,
          "end": 287.763,
          "en": "and definitely something you will encounter in Vue apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.01,
          "end": 291.01,
          "en": "Now let's have a look at knowledge grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.01,
          "end": 293.86,
          "en": "In knowledge grid, I'm using topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 293.86,
          "end": 296.47,
          "en": "I'm also getting this as props and I'm using it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 296.47,
          "end": 299.45,
          "en": "So this is no longer a pass through component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.45,
          "end": 301.87,
          "en": "There's needs and users topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.87,
          "end": 304.92,
          "en": "But I also emit select-topic here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.92,
          "end": 308.37,
          "en": "and that is still being passed through basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.37,
          "end": 311.54,
          "en": "Because ultimately it's the knowledge element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.54,
          "end": 313.59,
          "en": "It's this component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 313.59,
          "end": 317.69,
          "en": "which emits select-topic when we click this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.69,
          "end": 320.45,
          "en": "So that's where this custom event is generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 320.45,
          "end": 322.46,
          "en": "the select-topic event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.46,
          "end": 327.1,
          "en": "And then both knowledge grid as well as knowledge base,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.1,
          "end": 331.753,
          "en": "just forward that custom event to App.vue in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.86,
          "end": 336.49,
          "en": "So the event gets funneled through to components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 336.49,
          "end": 340.68,
          "en": "and topics also gets funneled through at least one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.68,
          "end": 343.87,
          "en": "through the knowledge base onto knowledge grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.87,
          "end": 345.46,
          "en": "So everything here works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 345.46,
          "end": 348.07,
          "en": "and that's also not a bad way of writing code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 348.07,
          "end": 349.87,
          "en": "And it does hopefully again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 349.87,
          "end": 352.43,
          "en": "show you how props and events work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 352.43,
          "end": 354.7,
          "en": "and how you can connect everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 354.7,
          "end": 357.55,
          "en": "But we still are facing a problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 357.55,
          "end": 358.78,
          "en": "We have the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 358.78,
          "end": 363.6,
          "en": "that we're having these unnecessary pass through steps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 363.6,
          "end": 366.45,
          "en": "I mean, it would be nice if knowledge base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 366.45,
          "end": 368.48,
          "en": "wouldn't have to deal with props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 368.48,
          "end": 370.18,
          "en": "and with emitting this event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 370.18,
          "end": 373.42,
          "en": "because neither of the two is used or generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 373.42,
          "end": 375.42,
          "en": "inside of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 375.42,
          "end": 379.38,
          "en": "We're just using both to connect it to knowledge grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 379.38,
          "end": 382.58,
          "en": "And it turns out that Vue has a solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 382.58,
          "end": 384.013,
          "en": "for problems like this.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
